        "register": "clinical",
        "authored_by": "synthetic_example"
      },
      {
        "key": "t04_colloquial",
        "text": "i just found a home pregnancy test in the cabinet and it came back clearly positive. the lower belly pain on my left side has gotten sharper over the last 2 hours and the bleeding is bright red now.",
        "sha256": "ae8c97fc6053105965b8707190a557440c07fde41b60a57c1a43f442bdc74555",
        "register": "colloquial",
        "authored_by": "synthetic_example"
      },
      {
        "key": "t05_clinical",
        "text": "I also developed a strange dull shoulder pain right at the tip of my left shoulder even though I did not strain it, and I feel nauseated with cold diaphoresis.",
